---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Noor & Knowledge — what this blog is and who it's for.">
  <article class="post-content">
    <h1>About This Blog</h1>
    <p>
      Noor & Knowledge is a small collection of short, sincere reflections on faith, worship, and
      everyday life — written in plain language for anyone who wants a quiet moment to read
      and think.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is intentionally simple: no ads, no tracking, no sign-up. Just posts. It's built
      as a static site, so it loads fast and can be hosted for free.
    </p>
    <h2>A note on accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      Religious content deserves care. Before publishing, verify quotes, hadith references, and
      rulings against reliable sources or a qualified scholar — this template ships with
      placeholder text that should be reviewed and replaced with vetted content.
    </p>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Spotted an error, or have a topic you'd like covered? Replace this paragraph with your
      own contact email or a link to a form.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
